fault shortcut: `F`) to the Scene Tree and FileSystem docks. When a filter/search is active, it clears the filter, expands parent nodes, and scrolls to the selected item — revealing its position in the full hierarchy.\r\n\r\nThe shortcut only fires when the filter is active. Otherwise `F` passes through to the Tree's built-in incremental search. Typing `F` in the filter text field still types the letter normally. No conflicts with viewport shortcuts.\r\n\r\nA context menu entry is also added, visible only when the filter is active.\r\n\r\n### Demo\r\n\r\n**FileSystem** — new \"Reveal in Tree (F)\" option:\r\n<img width=\"508\" height=\"396\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/690d55ae-9f30-49d3-9b9c-60e626055abd\" />\r\n\r\n**Scene Tree** — new \"Reveal in Tree (F)\" option:\r\n<img width=\"527\" height=\"569\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c85ecce0-91fd-42a5-a64c-d8d16b77118c\" />\r\n\r\n**Video of the feature**:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/afc9ba38-1e2d-4e51-adfe-6252e64559b5\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure\r\n\r\nCode was written by an LLM (Claude) based on my directions, then reviewed, tested, and iterated on by me.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-11T1